WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:20:00.000
Project JoyTwin on Self-Funded Camp and Hunting Expedition (1st Attempt, Zero-Shot, Solved in 973.9s): under native campfire-waypoint respawn rules, JoyTwin initially rushes down the corridor unarmored and dies, then adapts upon respawning at the camp arch—crafting and equipping a Rawhide Chestpiece, trading with the merchant for 57 coins while keeping a Minor Potion, solo-killing both 25 HP Green Legooms, and returning alive to the arch.
